o accounted for 16% and Li, Cu, Al, Fe accounted for 2%, 10%, 3%, and 19% of the mass, respectively.\"], \"case_id\": \"source-98d7e11c7ecce524\", \"paper\": \"A Combined Recovery Process of Metals in Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries\", \"node_id\": \"http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Combined%20Recovery%20Process%20of%20Metals%20in%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Component_lithium_ion_battery\"}" ;
    analysis:state "Dismantled for whole-battery analysis" ;
